Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Rainy Urban Intersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasObstacle :billboard1 ;
    :hasActor :trafficSign1 .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:billboard1 a :Billboard .

:trafficSign1 a :TrafficSign .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of collision due to poor visibility and wet road conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class  
